message: "If you use Mergen, please cite the software using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "Mergen: Manuscript Layout Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Mergen is a full-stack manuscript layout analysis application that runs
  three YOLO models in parallel, combines their results into unified
  annotations, and provides interactive review and export tools.
